{"id":"198962a762201c14","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient.md","title":"自然数 PER 的唯一数码类","display":"thm-natural-number-per-quotient — 自然数 PER 的唯一数码类","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient","aliases":["72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient"],"display":"thm-natural-number-per-quotient — 自然数 PER 的唯一数码类","depends_on":["[[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]]","[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §3.10, print750/PDF762; local finite-induction proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-natural-number-per-quotient — 自然数 PER 的唯一数码类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"48778817c308e85e\" href=\"?note=48778817c308e85e\" title=\"72-df-natural-number-membership-per\">72-df-natural-number-membership-per</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §3.10, print750/PDF762; local finite-induction proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Neq、ν、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e\">\\(\\mathfrak e\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"48778817c308e85e\" href=\"?note=48778817c308e85e\" title=\"72-df-natural-number-membership-per\">72-df-natural-number-membership-per</a>；PER、支撑及商类取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"855f0d0656844c14\" href=\"?note=855f0d0656844c14\" title=\"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation\">72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Neq}\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e),\\qquad\n\\nu(m)\\operatorname{Neq}\\nu(n)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ m=n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Neq}\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e),\\qquad\n\\nu(m)\\operatorname{Neq}\\nu(n)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ m=n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\operatorname{Neq}t\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (s\\operatorname{Neq}\\nu(n)\\land t\\operatorname{Neq}\\nu(n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\operatorname{Neq}t\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (s\\operatorname{Neq}\\nu(n)\\land t\\operatorname{Neq}\\nu(n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle n,[\\nu(n)]_{\\operatorname{Neq}}\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}:\n\\omega\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}|\\operatorname{Neq}|/\\operatorname{Neq}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{\\langle n,[\\nu(n)]_{\\operatorname{Neq}}\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}:\n\\omega\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}|\\operatorname{Neq}|/\\operatorname{Neq}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>各 N_k 递增。对称交换求值见证；传递把两条关系提升到共同有限阶段，中间项的唯一值使它们同为零或同一个后继，后者用子关系传递及后继单射性。Kleene 相等保证任一根求值见证在等价项上仍成立。再按最小有限展开深度归纳，每个相关对都对应唯一有限后继链长度 n；零/后继不交保证长度唯一。这给出商类双射，而不要求所有原始闭项都能终止。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-natural-number-membership-per","status":"resolved","id":"48778817c308e85e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"855f0d0656844c14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-natural-number-membership-per","status":"resolved","id":"48778817c308e85e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"Neq、ν、$\\mathfrak e$ 取 [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]]；PER、支撑及商类取 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]。$s,t\\in T$，$m,n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","stat